            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time the bearer fights, it makes 1 additional attack with this weapon. Each time an attack made with this weapon hits a VEHICLE unit, that attack inflicts 1 mortal wound in addition to any damage.</characteristic>
