            <characteristic name="Abilities" typeId="837d-5e63-aeb7-1410">Each time an attack is made with this weapon, that attack automatically hits the target. Each time an attack is made with the weapon, an unmodified wound roll of 5-6 inflicts 2 mortal wounds on the target and the attack sequence ends.</characteristic>
