          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">During deployment, you can set up this model in reserves, ready to deploy via jump pack, instead of placing it on the battlefield. At the end of any of your movement phases the model can make an aerial drop - set it up anywhere on the battlefield that is more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models.</characteristic>
